								"{{bulkJobId}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "The bulk job is processed asynchronously by analytics-worker/bulk-processor via RabbitMQ. Re-run this request (Send, not Runner) a few times a couple of seconds apart if status is still PENDING/PROCESSING - Postman does not poll on its own."
					},
